                                                                                                  <li><a href="/course/cpr-fa/1/">chapter 1 - CPR – Introduction</a></li>
                                                                                                    <li><a href="/course/cpr-fa/2/">chapter 2 - Recognizing and Responding to an Emergency</a></li>
                                                                                                    <li><a href="/course/cpr-fa/3/">chapter 3 - C-A-B: Compressions, Airway, Breathing</a></li>
                                                                                                    <li><a href="/course/cpr-fa/4/">chapter 4 - Adult CPR – Compressions</a></li>
                                                                                                    <li><a href="/course/cpr-fa/5/">chapter 5 - Adult CPR – Airway and Breaths</a></li>
                                                                                                    <li><a href="/course/cpr-fa/6/">chapter 6 - Using an AED</a></li>
                                                                                                    <li><a href="/course/cpr-fa/7/">chapter 7 - Putting It All Together</a></li>
